   "title": "Pythagoras",
   "text": "The resultant is the diagonal: \\( R = \\sqrt{3^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{25} = 5 \\) N.",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Choose",
   "text": "5 N is option **B**. (7 N would need the forces to point the same way.) The printed stem says “…than their resultant…”; we keep the book’s wording (flag F11).",
   "actions": []
  }
 ],
